%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/p { 1 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
1 2 transform p 1 2 dtransform p 1 2 itransform p 1 2 idtransform p
3 4 [2 0 0 2 1 1] transform p 3 4 [2 0 0 2 1 1] dtransform p 3 4 [2 0 0 2 1 1] itransform p 3 4 [2 0 0 2 1 1] idtransform p
10 20 translate 2 3 scale 30 rotate 1 1 transform p 1 1 itransform p
(a) transform
(a) 1 transform
1 [1 0 0 1 0 0] transform
[0 0 0 0 0 0] setmatrix 1 1 itransform p
